 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 나 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">멘토의 역할</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선발된 멘토는 과목 지도교수가 부과한 역할 및 멘토 업무를 성실히 수행</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">배정 교과목 수강생들의 요구 사항을 성실히 수행</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(1-1 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">멘토링 요청 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">멘토 의무사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주 멘토 시간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시간 초과 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">멘토 활동 종료 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수업 담당 교수의 확인을 받아 결과서류를 사업팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대학별 담당</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">멘토 포기 사유</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">휴학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자퇴</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">징계</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">취업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">업무태만 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">발생 시 즉시 포기 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">멘토는 멘토비가 지급될 때까지 재학생의 신분을 유지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">멘토 제출 서류</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">활동 종료 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">결과보고서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">근무일지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지도관련 자료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개인정보활용동의서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">통장 및 신분증 사본 등 요구자료</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"m